#. ja: 何をする？
#. de: Was möchtest du tun?
#. fr: Que voulez-vous faire<nbsp>?
msgctxt "custom/009/CtsMkdEntrance_00929:TEXT_CTSMKDENTRANCE_00929_Q1_000_000:1"
msgid "What would you like to do?"
msgstr "Что хотите сделать?"

#. ja: 「<sheet ContentFinderCondition $n1 43>」に突入する
#. de: <sheet ContentFinderCondition $n1 43> betreten
#. fr: Explorer l'<lower-first><sheet ContentFinderCondition $n1 43></lower-first>
#. macro: <sheet ContentFinderCondition $n1 43> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = ContentFinderCondition, row = number parameter 1, column = 43 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/009/CtsMkdEntrance_00929:TEXT_CTSMKDENTRANCE_00929_MENU_CONTENT:1"
msgid "Journey to <sheet ContentFinderCondition $n1 43>."
msgstr "Отправиться в <sheet ContentFinderCondition $n1 43>."

#. ja: 「蜃気楼の島 クレセントアイル」について詳しく聞く
#. de: Mehr über Kreszentia erfahren
#. fr: En savoir plus sur l'île de Lunule
msgctxt "custom/009/CtsMkdEntrance_00929:TEXT_CTSMKDENTRANCE_00929_A1_000_001:1"
msgid "Ask for more information."
msgstr "Запросить подробности."

#. ja: キャンセル
#. de: Abbrechen
#. fr: Rien en particulier
msgctxt "custom/009/CtsMkdEntrance_00929:TEXT_CTSMKDENTRANCE_00929_A1_000_002:1"
msgid "Nothing."
msgstr "Ничего."

#. ja: ナレッジレベルと通貨の確認
#. de: Wissensstufe und Währungen prüfen
#. fr: Voir le niveau de savoir et les devises
msgctxt "custom/009/CtsMkdEntrance_00929:TEXT_CTSMKDENTRANCE_00929_A1_000_003:1"
msgid "Review your knowledge level and currencies."
msgstr "Посмотреть уровень знаний и валюты."

#. ja: サポートジョブの確認
#. de: Phantomjobs einsehen
#. fr: Voir les jobs de soutien
msgctxt "custom/009/CtsMkdEntrance_00929:TEXT_CTSMKDENTRANCE_00929_A1_000_004:1"
msgid "Review your phantom jobs."
msgstr "Посмотреть фантомные профессии."

#. ja: 「<sheet ContentFinderCondition $n1 43>」に<br>突入しますか？<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※ナレッジレベルが20を超えている場合、<br>ナレッジレベル20に自動調整されます。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: <sheet ContentFinderCondition $n1 43> betreten?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※ Falls deine Wissensstufe höher als 20 ist, wird sie automatisch auf diesen Wert herabgesetzt.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: S'enregistrer pour l'<lower-first><sheet ContentFinderCondition $n1 43></lower-first><nbsp>?<br>* Si votre niveau de savoir est supérieur à 20, il sera ajusté au<shy>to<shy>ma<shy>ti<shy>que<shy>ment à ce niveau.
#. macro: <sheet ContentFinderCondition $n1 43> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = ContentFinderCondition, row = number parameter 1, column = 43 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "custom/009/CtsMkdEntrance_00929:TEXT_CTSMKDENTRANCE_00929_MENU_CONTENT_CONFIRMINATION_SOUTH:1"
msgid "Journey to <sheet ContentFinderCondition $n1 43>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※If your knowledge level is above 20, it will be synced.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Отправиться в <sheet ContentFinderCondition $n1 43>?<br><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※ Если ваш уровень знаний выше 20, его снизят до 20.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

